/K [664 0 R 665 0 R 666 0 R 667 0 R 668 0 R 669 0 R 670 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (Flowchart depicting six stages of generating a final explanation. Stage 1: Input event and social role recognition by RASA. Stage 2: Retrieves effect and cause. Stage 3: Generates initial causal explanation using a dictionary. Stage 4: Refines syntax. Stage 5: Produces final explanation with Llama. Arrows indicate process flow and interconnections between stages.)
/ID (ID.0062)
>>
